# 20. Quantifiers

Quantifiers specify **how many times something should appear**.

Important quantifiers:

| Quantifier | Meaning         |
| ---------- | --------------- |
| `*`        | 0 or more       |
| `+`        | 1 or more       |
| `?`        | 0 or 1          |
| `{n}`      | Exactly n       |
| `{n,}`     | n or more       |
| `{n,m}`    | Between n and m |

---

